{"parse": {"title": "AFF-04", "pageid": 123502, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-03\" title=\"AFF-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-05\" title=\"AFF-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.BD.9C.E6.84.8F.E8.AF.86.E7.8C.8E.E6.89.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"潜意识猎手\">潜意识猎手</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 潜意识猎手</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Unconscious Hunting</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>总<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>负<span class=\"color-value\"></span>责<span class=\"color-value\"></span>做<span class=\"color-value\"></span>梦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210104</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_74_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_74_zone\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_74_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3f/Cg-3_2_at_74_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"467\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"432\" data-file-height=\"336\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>塔沃尼尔家的人都会不可避免地追逐宝藏，并在冒险的途中遭遇不幸。身边亲近之人或接手宝藏的人也会沾染这样的厄运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>但你并不相信这个预言，对吗？——阿黛拉·塔沃尼尔，或者“灰调蓝”小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>僻静的谈话室中，除了摄像机运作的少许杂音外，四周再听不见其他多余动静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻女子的证言一字不落地被收音设备捕捉，化作磁性材料上记录的冰冷信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>事到如今，倒也不是完全不信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无奈地笑了笑，低头看着自己的手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>可就算它真的会在某一天应验，那又如何呢？<br />所有人都知道人终有一死，但大家仍然在好好生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>在某个命运的分歧点真正来临之前，我并不打算每天战战兢兢地活着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她稍作停顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>或者说，即使结局无可更改，我也不希望按预设的剧本生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>那天，我载着西莉亚前往她家……我也这么回答了她。回过头想，也许从那时起一切就改变了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_2_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_2_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_2_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>嗯——好吃！<br />我一直不明白，土豆怎么也可以做得这么美味！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>其实和学校食堂一个水平。你自己不怎么做饭，当然觉得格外好吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>是啊，毕竟小时候我那倒霉老爸只会端出各种野营罐头，然后说“在丛林里有这个吃就谢天谢地吧”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>可我现在都还没离开过巴黎半步！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>西莉亚笑着摇了摇头，接过空盘，为好友又盛上了一份土豆泥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>是你自己选的，说什么绝对不会成为宝石猎人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我绝不要按规定好的剧本生活——而且这事也有你的一份，别忘了当时翻开那套印着招聘广告的报纸时，可是你挑的页数！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>西莉亚说不过她，往土豆泥上又浇了两勺炖菜，垒起一座小山，推到阿黛拉面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>算了，瞧你这副能说会道的样子——我们的司机女士最近有没有遇见什么趣事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>还真有一个。只是与其说是“趣事”，不如说是“怪事”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬着勺子努力回忆不久前的情景，占卜师的表情在脑海中仍然清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我去了玛莱区的一家占卜沙龙。里头的占卜师是个招摇撞骗的家伙，甚至骗到了我头上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她对我说了一些奇怪的预言，听起来和“塔沃尼尔的诅咒”很像……然后她突然倒下，就这么……死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>……死了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>西莉亚睁大眼睛，手里的叉子不自觉地磕碰着餐盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>反正警察已经在处理了。别太担心。至于那些预言，你也知道我向来不信，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>那你怎么突然想着跑去占卜沙龙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我？可不是我想去，是我的老主顾费利西安大小姐一时兴起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>今天的撞车也是……算了，不聊工作了。你呢，有没有碰见值得说说的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>西莉亚没有顺着阿黛拉的提问说下去。她敏锐地抓住了这段话中的几个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>老主顾？没听你提起过她，是我住在学校太久了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>拜托，这里就不要用疑问句了吧！<br />你再多消失几个月，小家伙搞不好就要忘记你的气味了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小家伙”：</div><div>吼……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉肩膀上的小生物闻言发出了疑似抗议的叫声，西莉亚隔空拍了拍它的脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>“小家伙”不是你的家传神秘术呼唤出来的守护神吗？按理说，只要你还记得我这号人，它就也永远不会忘记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>它的记忆就是你的记忆，它甚至能读到你自己无法察觉的潜意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我可听不懂，也记不住这些复杂的理论……这是你现在的研究课题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>罗西教授从一位瑞士心理学家处获得了很多启发，现在正带着整个课题组快速突破，我们的研究已经初有成效了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>又是那个什么……可收集意识？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>是集体潜意识！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高材生严肃地推了推眼镜，打开手边的笔记本。差生意识到问题不妙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>行，我记住了！我保证——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>潜意识领域可比你想的要复杂多了，阿黛拉。其中可能还有着能够改变巴黎的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>我们每个人就像是一座座湖中的小岛，有意识的记忆就是岛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>而储存意识不到的记忆的，则是连接我们所有人的这片湖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>这就是荣格认为的集体潜意识，它被所有人共享。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-641417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-641417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-641417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>而战争，贫富差距，神秘学家与人类之间不曾停止的斗争……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-641417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-641417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-641417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>这些就像是岛上的树木，你砍掉它们后，只要根系还在，就会再次长出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兴致勃勃的学者合上笔记，用征询的目光抓住了阿黛拉，等待着她的反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>现在大家的日子都不好过，这是事实……可这和我们的潜意识有什么关系呢？难道是我们自己想要这些纷争吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>当然不是！可它的确是我们集体潜意识的一部分，会在历史中反复上演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>想要消除这些代表纷争的树木，就要将它连根拔起。这几乎是不可能的。<br />但如果我们能够影响到下方的湖，将和平与平等的水流注入湖中呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>哪怕是一股微小的水流，也可能会被树根吸收，进而改变一棵树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>我们的研究就是，如何更加科学且直观地去影响集体潜意识，进而改变大众。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>这可比任何改革法案都要有效！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉挠了挠脑袋，她没有这么远大的志向，也无意去改变谁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>所以你们的研究就是……如何控制每一个人的思想？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>当然不！个体的思想仍然会得到保留，我们只是留下了那么一个点子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>把一个美好的愿景留在集体潜意识中，即便短期内不会有成果，但可能性已经存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>雨果想象不到那美好的一天要如何到来，但他还是把梦想都写成了书，并传达给了每个法国人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>我们也是如此，不过不依赖于文学创作这类不可控的方式，而是更加科学的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那文森特呢？他看起来可是个拿破仑狂热分子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>你们的研究不会有什么风险吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>……我不会说“肯定没有”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>集体潜意识中有着文明的原始意象，那些在人群中共通的艺术、传说与梦，越是有普遍性，在集体潜意识中就越有影响力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>文森特应该是“拿破仑”感染了……该说不说，他以前就有这方面的嗜好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>毕竟，改变人的认知总是伴随着精神错乱的风险。在找到安全的研究方法之前，文森特不会是最后一个意外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>普遍性……共通的传说……精神错乱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉忽然心中一动。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>于是它才自百年的沉睡中苏醒，现身于这个时代，将诅咒施加于众人！<br />是我们唤醒了它——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_2_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_2_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_2_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>比如“热沃当的野兽”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉念出了那个在占卜沙龙上听到的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>你是说最近在城里传得沸沸扬扬的那个？<br />但历史上其实根本不存在什么“热沃当的野兽”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>等等，也许这说得通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>恐惧“热沃当的野兽”的种子通过传言汇入集体潜意识中，接着被个体吸收，然后发芽……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>这说得通！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好友从餐桌上跳起，直扑自己放在一旁的笔记本，开始在上面写写画画了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-641401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>谢谢你，阿黛拉，你总是能够给我提供全新的灵感！我得再去研究一下那幅死亡之舞壁画了——这一切也许都是关联的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-641410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-641410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-641410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>等我的研究结果出版，我一定会用稿费给你买一条最漂亮的好运项链！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那你得好好选，我可会每天都戴着它出门的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在涉及到自己的研究时，好友往往会展现百倍于平时的热情，阿黛拉对此已见怪不怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>你打算去干什么特别的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>没错，不过具体是什么暂且保密，等到我确定了后一定会第一个分享给你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>我保证你……不，说不定全世界都会为这个发现而震惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>说起来你可别笑我。有时我会觉得自己也是一名城市里的冒险家……用我手中的纸与笔，发掘着埋在厚重历史中的宝藏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>某种意义上——就像你的父母一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>抱歉，我太激动了……我说得有点多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>他们可算不上什么负责的人，西莉亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我最近又收到了他们的来信。里头还是一个劲地在提发现了值钱的矿产，见到了古老壁画之类的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>噢，你已经读了吗？听起来很不错！我是说——真的，我很喜欢这些冒险故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好友骤然积极的态度让阿黛拉哭笑不得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我有时候觉得你才更像塔沃尼尔家的一员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>哈哈……是这样就好啦。你明天打算和那位老主顾去哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>和平街的水晶工房。我有些想确认的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>你是不是在想那个占卜师的预言？可别被你的潜意识奴役，阿黛拉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>又到了你的专业领域是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>我说了，绝大多数问题的根源都在人们的脑海深处……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xingkong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xingkong\"><img alt=\"xingkong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/600px-Cg-xingkong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/900px-Cg-xingkong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/1200px-Cg-xingkong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阔别许久的好友间总有说不尽的话，也不知过了多久，星星占据了整片天空，在夜幕中闪耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>西莉亚，你说，世上真的有命运吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-313518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-313518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-313518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>嗯？西莉亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>友人已进入了梦乡，奔赴了某个尚未和阿黛拉在“集体潜意识的海洋”中连通的梦境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>好吧，晚安……祝我俩明天都一路平安。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_74_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_74_zone\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_74_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3f/Cg-3_2_at_74_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"467\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"432\" data-file-height=\"336\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>于是第二天，你前往了贝丽尔·布翁尼的水晶工房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>你说你在那里接受了一场“奇异的占卜”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔·布翁尼……她早就预见了我的造访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>正如她早就预见了在那之后发生的一切。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-04"}}